            <a href="https://help.zipcaptions.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 hover:text-teal-brand hover:bg-teal-50/70 transition-colors">
